    ],
    "retrieved": "2026-10-02",
    "units": "unified atomic mass units (u, Da)",
    "Mass_amu_policy": "Mass_amu is the value periodica serves as the element's atomic weight. value_kind 'standard': the CIAAW 2021 standard atomic weight. 'abridged': the standard atomic weight is an interval, so the CIAAW 2021 abridged value is used (the value printed on the IUPAC periodic table); the interval itself is kept under standard_atomic_weight. 'none': CIAAW gives no standard atomic weight (no stable isotope and no characteristic terrestrial isotopic composition); periodica then uses the AME2020 atomic mass of the nuclide named by the atom's own Composition (see ame2020_atomic_masses.json).",
